==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|NL.|en}} {{m|la|sensorius}} (compare {{etyl|LL.|-}} {{m|la|sensorium}}), from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|sensus||feeling; sense}}, from {{m|la|sentire||to feel}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈsɛnsəri/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Of the [[sense]]s or [[sensation]].

====Usage notes====
Prefix combining form is ''sensori-'', as in {{m|en|sensorimotor}}.

